# ============================================================================
# Notes
# ============================================================================
# - Either `generic_artifact_content_source` OR `generic_artifact_content_content` should be provided.
# - Use null for optional fields to skip them.
# - Ensure artifact_path follows OCI naming conventions (lowercase, hyphenated).
# - Version should follow semantic versioning (e.g., 1.0.0, 1.2.3-alpha).

